    <string name="story_codex_title">Record Archive</string>
    <string name="story_codex_level">Level 0 — The Waiting Room</string>
    <string name="story_codex_level_body">Endless mono-yellow office corridors. Damp carpet, humming fluorescents, rooms that lead nowhere. In some regions the lights have failed entirely — there, only your flashlight shows the way.</string>
    <string name="story_codex_survival">Survival</string>
    <string name="story_codex_survival_body">Sanity drains with entity proximity and flickering light, and slowly recovers in calm, lit spaces. The flashlight only consumes battery while switched on. Moving costs stamina.</string>
    <string name="story_codex_entities">Entities</string>
    <string name="story_codex_entities_body">Eight kinds wander here, each driven by its own behaviour tree: some follow sound, some wait until you enter their line of sight, some hunt outright. An entity that enters its attack state will hurt you at close range.</string>
    <string name="story_codex_exit">The Exit</string>
    <string name="story_codex_exit_body">Every run places the exit at the furthest point from where you landed. A prompt appears once you are close; the interact button gets you out.</string>
